Subject: [PATCH 52/54] arm64: dts: renesas: v3msk: add EtherAVB support
Date: Thu,  7 Dec 2017 10:53:55 +0100
Message-Id: <a6b1b7359074229504b2a81837eaf6ec54d3b300.1512640145.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
